id=ternak_tt
name=Ternak TT — Zygisk Fresh Persona
version=v1.2.3
versionCode=1203
author=Ilham311
description=Zygisk device spoofer targeting TikTok + Grab Passenger. 6-layer Java hook + 78 native prop spoofs + L7 TYPED spoof tables + companion fork+setns bind mount overlay. v1.2.0: ShadowHook + lsplant now consumed as prebuilt AAR from Maven Central. v1.2.1: Removed -fno-exceptions -fno-rtti for try/catch. v1.2.2: Fixed build.sh copy_shadowhook_so still pointed at v1.1.9 build tree. v1.2.3: CRITICAL LINKER FIX — lsplant.hpp/shadowhook.h were being included INSIDE `namespace ternak_tt::java_hooks`, which nested lsplant's own namespace as `ternak_tt::java_hooks::lsplant::v2::*`, mangling calls to a symbol liblsplant.so never exports. v1.1.7-v1.2.2 linked only because LSPlant 6.4 emitted Init as inline; newer LSPlant AAR broke that. Includes moved to global scope. Works on Zygisk-Next / HMA-OSS, KernelSU + LSPosed, Android 12-16.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Ilham311/Tt/main/update.json
